<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0213c6cd500e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Musk Says 2022 Tesla Crash Driver Didn’t Have Full-Self Driving Tech" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3455" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/03ee66331c1a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Colorado State Patrol Sgt. Robert Madden, who led the investigation, has rolling tire marks at the site of the crash, which means that the motor kept sending power to the wheels at the time of impact." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3449" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0822539a46e4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Electrek’s Take" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7727" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/09bb52590dfc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Hans Von Ohain, 33, died at the scene after his 2021 Tesla Model 3 went off the road, slammed into a tree and caught fire." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3452" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/147ecd75ebc5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Washington Post released a new report on the crash today, which happened back in 2022." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3449" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/148ca8661ff0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The tragic fatal crash of a Tesla employee allegedly using Full Self-Driving (FSD) Beta in 2022 has been extensively reported." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3457" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/14f63a188365> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "What's still unknown is why Von Ohain could not get out of the car and if the car was using an auto-drive function at the time of the crash." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3452" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/16499db51752> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3447] The car's driver-assistance software, Full Self-Driving, was struggling to navigate the mountain curves, forcing von Ohain repeatedly to yank it back on course." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3447" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/19dcc1c09694> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Shoemaker provided training to the Evergreen Fire Protection District after this crash and said he believes the driver was awake and alert but was unable to open the door." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3453" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1d5be34aa7bf> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla Employee Who Loved Elon Musk Reportedly Killed by Full Self-Driving" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3448" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1f5e70ccb83a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3452] Earlier this month, after pressure from NHTSA, Tesla announced a recall of more than 350,000 of its vehicles with 'full driving' or 'auto drive system.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3452" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/204d1dd826a2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "FTC: We use income earning auto affiliate links." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7727" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/205f736558bc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla has promoted its self-driving technology, Full Self-Driving, as the solution to the 40,000 annual road deaths in the US each year." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3451" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/21fd36e67c94> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In a 911 dispatch call heard by the Washington Post, Rossiter told 911 that von Ohain was '[using an auto-drive feature on the Tesla' that 'just ran straight off the road]." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3451" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2d8a2d3e7910> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Earlier this month, after pressure from NHTSA, Tesla announced a recall of more than 350,000 of its vehicles with \"full driving\" or \"auto drive system.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3452" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2f7ceee99f22> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[7673] Full Self-Driving (FSD) expands on the company's Autopilot driver assistance software, and is designed to make decisions on behalf of the user while driving on both highways and busy city streets." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7673" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3b54fd9e05ee> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6076] Hans von Ohain, a Tesla recruiter, died in a car crash on a Colorado mountain road after his Tesla Model 3 veered off the road and barreled into a tree, bursting into flames." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6076" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4480e8652b63> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla worker died in horrible crash on Full Self-Driving beta, but he was also drunk" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7727" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4521f565c82b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Since federal regulators began requiring automakers to report crashes involving driver-assistance systems in 2021, they have logged more than 900 in Teslas." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3447" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4569e77685f7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Nora Bass, the widow of Ohain, acknowledged her husband's faith in Elon Musk's autonomous car vision, but she also chastised Tesla for its lack of comment on the incident, implying that they were \"just guinea pigs\" testing the technology under false pretenses of safety." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3463" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/46aba3bce337> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Paul Shoemaker, a Castle Rock firefighter and paramedic, also owns Next Level Extrication, a company that trains emergency workers on how to save lives in car crashes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3453" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/490997e1629f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla’s Full Self-Driving Software: Questioning Responsibility and Safety" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3462" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4ab6e6d68b8c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla Sold ‘False Sense Of Security’ To Employee Killed In Suspected Full Self-Driving Crash" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3454" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4ec31ef10f2f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Colorado State Patrol wraps up investigation into fatal Evergreen Tesla crash, fire" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3452" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4f308c916821> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6076] Hans von Ohain, a Tesla recruiter, died in a car crash on a Colorado mountain road after his Tesla Model 3 veered off the road and barreled into a tree, bursting into flames, according to a new report from The Washington Post." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6076" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/55759e737c01> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla has promoted its self-driving technology, Full Self-Driving, as the solution to the 40,000 annual road deaths in the US each year." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6131" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5d6ce085008e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Full Self-Driving (FSD) expands on the company's Autopilot driver assistance software, and is designed to make decisions on behalf of the user while driving on both highways and busy city streets." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3448" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/62ddb3710bfa> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3452] Earlier this month, after pressure from NHTSA, Tesla announced a recall of more than 350,000 of its vehicles with 'full driving' or 'auto drive system.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3452" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/65cd5e4f70dd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Although Tesla's Autopilot technology---which is intended to be used on highways---has been implicated in multiple collisions, the Full Self-Driving technology, which is intended to guide Tesla vehicles through almost any situation, has not been conclusively linked to any fatalities." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3463" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/680de96d9f95> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Nora Bass, Ohain's widow, told the Post her husband believed in Elon Musk's vision for the future of autonomous vehicles so much that he was willing to tolerate the \"jerky\" experience to help improve Tesla's self-driving technology." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6076" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6d94cf3218f7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3447] The car's driver-assistance software, Full Self-Driving, was struggling to navigate the mountain curves, forcing von Ohain repeatedly to yank it back on course." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3447" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/716e917ca901> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Most involved Autopilot, which is designed for use on controlled-access highways." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3447" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7bce4fcaee1a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Wife of Tesla employee who died in what may have been the first Full Self-Driving crash said she and her husband were 'guinea pigs'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3450" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7db358502fb4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Hans von Ohain, a Tesla recruiter, died in a car crash on a Colorado mountain road after his Tesla Model 3 veered off the road and barreled into a tree, bursting into flames, according to a new report from The Washington Post." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6076" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7e992202a9b2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Survivor alleges Tesla auto-drive failed in fatal crash, Musk denies" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3457" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7eed6ce2f4df> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Given Elon Musk's claims about the technology's capabilities, his widow, Nora Bass, expressed worries about the false sense of security FSD provides, per The Post." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3459" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/840430ce603f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla Full-Self Driving Fatal Crash In Spotlight: Musk 'Sold False Sense Of Security'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3458" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/892d0a3efe9c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A Tesla recruiter lost his life in a tragic incident in 2022 while using the electric vehicle's (EV) Full Self-Driving (FSD) feature." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3459" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8b07a8393848> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The untimely demise of Tesla recruiter Hans von Ohain in a collision involving a Model 3 on a route in Colorado's mountains has prompted serious concerns about the reliability and security of Tesla's autonomous driving technology." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3463" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8d51386aaaff> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "While investigations concluded that intoxication was a primary factor, questions remain regarding Tesla's driver-assistance technology's role in the accident." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3457" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8fb449b6d09f> a airo:Evidence ;
